WEBVTT

1
00:00:06.900 --> 00:00:10.710
WEWERE IN ASTORE
AND A GUY IN THAT STORE

3
00:00:13.410 --> 00:00:15.680
"WHAT THE HELL ARE
YOU TALKING ABOUT?"

4
00:00:15.680 --> 00:00:16.940
HE SAYS...

5
00:00:18.350 --> 00:00:21.210
THE USA IS IN
A WAR WITH JAPAN.

6
00:00:21.420 --> 00:00:22.850
WE COULDN'T
BELIEVE IT.

7
00:00:22.850 --> 00:00:25.590
WELL OUR COUNTRY
WAS ATTACKED.

8
00:00:25.590 --> 00:00:26.620
IT'S DIFFERENT.

9
00:00:26.620 --> 00:00:28.960
IT WASN'T LIKE
KOREA OR VIETNAM.

10
00:00:28.960 --> 00:00:29.960
WE WAS ATTACKED.

11
00:00:29.960 --> 00:00:33.450
AND YOU KNOW
IT WAS A FEELING THAT...

12
00:00:33.600 --> 00:00:36.970
MAYBE WE'RE JUST
DUMB COUNTRY PEOPLE BUT

13
00:00:36.970 --> 00:00:40.240
WHERE I COME FROM BUT
A LOT OF US VOLUNTEERED.

14
00:00:40.240 --> 00:00:42.400
WHO WOULD LIKE TO VOLUNTEER
FOR THE TANK CORPS?

15
00:00:42.400 --> 00:00:44.970
WHO WOULD LIKE TO VOLUNTEER
FOR THE AIR FORCE?

16
00:00:44.970 --> 00:00:49.040
WHO WOULD LIKE TO VOLUNTEER
FOR THE NAVY OR WHATEVER?

17
00:00:49.040 --> 00:00:50.280
AND THEN THEY SAID

18
00:00:50.280 --> 00:00:52.850
"WHO WOULD LIKE TO VOLUNTEER
FOR THE AIRBORNE?"

19
00:00:52.850 --> 00:00:55.420
SOMEBODY SAYS "WHAT THE
HELL'S THE AIRBORNE?"

20
00:00:55.420 --> 00:00:57.020
NOBODY EVER HEARD OF IT.

21
00:00:57.020 --> 00:00:58.990
WE CAME FROM
A SMALL SMALL TOWN

22
00:00:58.990 --> 00:01:03.160
AND THREE FELLAS IN THAT TOWN
WERE THAT WERE "4F"

23
00:01:03.160 --> 00:01:06.830
COMMITTED SUICIDE
BECAUSE THEY COULDN'T GO

24
00:01:06.830 --> 00:01:08.630
A DIFFERENT TIME.

25
00:01:09.230 --> 00:01:10.270
I DID THINGS.

26
00:01:10.270 --> 00:01:12.000
I DIDN'T DO 'EM
FOR MEDALS

27
00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:12.930
I DIDN'T DO 'EM
FOR ACCOLADES.

28
00:01:12.930 --> 00:01:16.340
I DID 'EM BECAUSE
IT'S WHAT HAD TO BE DONE.

29
00:01:16.340 --> 00:01:18.170
THE GUY SAYS "WOULD YOU
JUMP OUT OF AIRPLANES?

30
00:01:18.170 --> 00:01:20.440
"YOU KNOW YOU GOT
ALL YOUR ARMY EQUIPMENT

31
00:01:20.440 --> 00:01:23.380
AND YOU JUMP OUT OF AIRPLANES
TO FIGHT THE ENEMY."

32
00:01:23.380 --> 00:01:25.880
THESE GUYS THEY SAID
"GO TO HELL".

33
00:01:25.880 --> 00:01:26.780
NOBODY PUT UP
THEIR HANDS.

34
00:01:26.780 --> 00:01:29.380
AND THEN I DON'T KNOW
WHAT IT WAS BROUGHT IT UP

35
00:01:29.380 --> 00:01:31.950
BUT THE GUY GIVING
THE SPEECH WAS SAYING

36
00:01:31.950 --> 00:01:34.590
"BUT YOU GET PAID
$50 A MONTH MORE."

37
00:01:34.590 --> 00:01:37.620
SO THAT MADE IT
A HUNDRED BUCKS.

38
00:04:31.270 --> 00:04:32.820
( chattering )

39
00:04:35.170 --> 00:04:37.070
( male )
I WANT A WHIFF
OF CHICKEN PIE.

40
00:04:37.070 --> 00:04:41.240
( male )
OKAY BOYS LET'S
GET THIS GEAR STOWED.

41
00:05:00.630 --> 00:05:02.030
FOX COMPANY

42
00:05:02.360 --> 00:05:03.920
WE GO IN FIVE.

43
00:05:11.770 --> 00:05:17.270
( male )
IN THE NAME OF THE FATHER
AND THE SON AND OF THE HOLY...

44
00:05:20.280 --> 00:05:22.880
( male )
1st PLATOON
DRAW SMALL ARMS.

45
00:05:22.880 --> 00:05:25.820
DO YOU NEED A HAND
LIEUTENANT?

46
00:05:27.320 --> 00:05:28.820
( male )
"EASY COMPANY!"

47
00:05:28.820 --> 00:05:30.150
LISTEN UP!

48
00:05:30.630 --> 00:05:31.230
GATHER UP AROUND ME.

49
00:05:31.230 --> 00:05:34.320
JUST MOVE IT UP
C'MON GENTLEMEN.

50
00:05:35.200 --> 00:05:36.460
LET'S GO!

51
00:05:39.070 --> 00:05:43.240
NOW THE CHANNEL COAST IS
SOCKED IN WITH RAIN AND FOG.

52
00:05:43.240 --> 00:05:45.570
HIGH WINDS ON
THE DROP ZONE.

53
00:05:45.570 --> 00:05:47.340
NO JUMP TONIGHT.

54
00:05:47.640 --> 00:05:49.740
THE INVASION
HAS BEEN POSTPONED.

55
00:05:49.740 --> 00:05:52.540
WE'RE ON A 24
HOUR STAND-DOWN.

56
00:05:52.810 --> 00:05:53.680
SONOFABITCH.

57
00:05:53.680 --> 00:05:56.380
DRILL SERGEANTS
TAKE CHARGE.

58
00:05:57.120 --> 00:05:59.990
Well this is
quite a surprise.

59
00:06:00.960 --> 00:06:01.720
Not particularly.

60
00:06:01.720 --> 00:06:04.890
It so happens
I rather expected it

61
00:06:05.530 --> 00:06:09.990
Well I can't
see how you people
can pass up $80000

62
00:06:10.200 --> 00:06:11.790
for the cause.

63
00:06:12.400 --> 00:06:13.470
For whose cause?

64
00:06:13.470 --> 00:06:16.300
If you're so interested
in serving a cause

65
00:06:16.300 --> 00:06:18.640
why don't you
join the army?

66
00:06:18.640 --> 00:06:19.500
Oh...

67
00:06:40.700 --> 00:06:43.100
I THINK
IT'S CLEARING UP.

68
00:06:46.070 --> 00:06:48.700
YOU THINK
IT'S CLEARING UP?

69
00:06:49.470 --> 00:06:50.160
NO.

70
00:06:51.410 --> 00:06:53.810
I THINK
IT'S CLEARING UP.

71
00:06:56.140 --> 00:06:58.040
HOW ARE YOUR MEN?

72
00:06:58.410 --> 00:07:00.140
THEY'LL BE FINE.

73
00:07:05.520 --> 00:07:07.390
FIVE O'CLOCK
IN NEW YORK.

74
00:07:07.390 --> 00:07:09.690
FOUR O'CLOCK
IN CHICAGO.

75
00:07:11.260 --> 00:07:13.090
HAPPY HOUR HUH?

76
00:07:13.390 --> 00:07:14.130
YEAH.

77
00:07:14.130 --> 00:07:15.490
HAPPY HOUR.

78
00:07:15.900 --> 00:07:16.730
A COUPLE OF DRINKS

79
00:07:16.730 --> 00:07:20.390
MAYBE AN EARLY DINNER
BEFORE THE THEATER.

80
00:07:26.040 --> 00:07:29.310
A CIVILIZED PLACE
FOR CIVILIZED MEN.

81
00:07:33.820 --> 00:07:36.650
SHOULD'VE BEEN
BORN EARLIER NIX.

82
00:07:36.650 --> 00:07:39.250
WHAT AND GIVE
UP ALL THIS?

83
00:07:53.600 --> 00:07:57.210
WE'LL GO TO CHICAGO
I'LL TAKE YOU THERE.

84
00:07:57.210 --> 00:07:58.070
YEAH.

85
00:07:59.770 --> 00:08:01.040
WE'LL SEE.

86
00:08:09.220 --> 00:08:12.350
ACTUALLY YOU KNOW
WHO'S FROM THERE?

87
00:08:12.350 --> 00:08:13.220
WHO?

88
00:08:13.550 --> 00:08:14.650
OH HIM.

89
00:08:15.160 --> 00:08:19.060
712 DAYS OF THAT
SONOFABITCH AND
HERE WE ARE.

90
00:08:36.180 --> 00:08:38.010
( flies buzzing )

91
00:08:44.850 --> 00:08:48.750
YOU PEOPLE ARE AT
THE POSITION OF ATTENTION.

92
00:08:56.060 --> 00:08:59.330
PRIVATE PERCONTE
HAVE YOU BEEN
BLOUSING YOUR TROUSERS

93
00:08:59.330 --> 00:09:02.200
OVER YOUR BOOTS
LIKE A PARATROOPER?

94
00:09:02.200 --> 00:09:02.670
NO SIR.

95
00:09:02.670 --> 00:09:04.540
THEN EXPLAIN
THE CREASES
AT THE BOTTOM.

96
00:09:04.540 --> 00:09:05.170
NO EXCUSE SIR.

97
00:09:05.170 --> 00:09:08.380
VOLUNTEERING FOR THE
PARACHUTE INFANTRY IS
ONE THING PERCONTE

98
00:09:08.380 --> 00:09:11.480
BUT YOU'VE GOT A LONG WAY TO
PROVE THAT YOU BELONG HERE.

99
00:09:11.480 --> 00:09:14.180
YOUR WEEKEND PASS
IS REVOKED.

100
00:09:14.950 --> 00:09:15.720
NAME?

101
00:09:15.720 --> 00:09:17.150
LUZ GEORGE.

102
00:09:17.920 --> 00:09:20.090
DIRT IN THE REAR
SIDE APERTURE.

103
00:09:20.090 --> 00:09:21.580
PASS REVOKED.

104
00:09:32.970 --> 00:09:35.970
WHEN DID YOU SEW
ON THESE CHEVRONS
SERGEANT LIPTON?

105
00:09:35.970 --> 00:09:37.470
YESTERDAY SIR.

106
00:09:37.470 --> 00:09:39.610
LONG ENOUGH
TO NOTICE THIS.

107
00:09:39.610 --> 00:09:40.700
REVOKED.

108
00:09:41.010 --> 00:09:41.800
SIR.

109
00:09:43.080 --> 00:09:44.010
NAME?

110
00:09:44.010 --> 00:09:45.910
MALARKEY DONALD G.

111
00:09:45.910 --> 00:09:46.480
MALARKEY?

112
00:09:46.480 --> 00:09:48.680
MALARKEY'S SLANG
FOR BULLSHIT
ISN'T IT?

113
00:09:48.680 --> 00:09:49.840
YES SIR.

114
00:09:50.180 --> 00:09:54.120
RUST ON THE BUTT
PLATE HINGE SPRING
PRIVATE BULLSHIT.

115
00:09:54.120 --> 00:09:55.210
REVOKED.

116
00:09:57.090 --> 00:09:57.630
NAME?

117
00:09:57.630 --> 00:09:59.960
LIEBGOTT
JOSEPH D SIR.

118
00:10:01.300 --> 00:10:03.500
RUSTY BAYONET
LIEBGOTT.

119
00:10:03.500 --> 00:10:05.800
YOU WANNA
KILL GERMANS?

120
00:10:06.500 --> 00:10:07.070
YES SIR.

121
00:10:07.070 --> 00:10:08.660
NOT WITH THIS.

122
00:10:10.140 --> 00:10:13.340
I WOULDN'T TAKE THIS
RUSTY PIECE OF SHIT TO WAR

123
00:10:13.340 --> 00:10:16.910
AND I WILL NOT TAKE YOU
TO WAR IN YOUR CONDITION.

124
00:10:16.910 --> 00:10:19.050
NOW THANKS TO THESE MEN
AND THEIR INFRACTIONS

125
00:10:19.050 --> 00:10:22.820
EVERY MAN IN THE COMPANY
WHO HAD A WEEKEND PASS

126
00:10:22.820 --> 00:10:24.250
HAS LOST IT.

127
00:10:26.120 --> 00:10:30.580
CHANGE INTO YOUR "PT" GEAR
WE'RE RUNNING CURRAHEE.

128
00:10:33.390 --> 00:10:34.960
2nd PLATOON
FALL OUT.

129
00:10:34.960 --> 00:10:36.130
WE HAVE TWO MINUTES.

130
00:10:36.130 --> 00:10:37.390
FALL OUT!

131
00:10:42.270 --> 00:10:44.010
I AIN'T GOING UP
THAT HILL.

132
00:10:44.010 --> 00:10:46.570
HEY PERCONTE
WHAT ARE YOU
THINKING OF

133
00:10:46.570 --> 00:10:47.840
BLOUSIN' YOUR PANTS?

134
00:10:47.840 --> 00:10:50.310
SHUT UP MARTIN
ALRIGHT?

135
00:10:50.380 --> 00:10:50.980
HE GIGGED EVERYBODY.

136
00:10:50.980 --> 00:10:52.410
YEAH WELL
YOU SHOULD KNOW BETTER.

137
00:10:52.410 --> 00:10:54.250
DON'T GIVE HIM
NO EXCUSES.

138
00:10:54.250 --> 00:10:54.950
EXCUSES?

139
00:10:54.950 --> 00:10:56.850
WHY DON'T YOU COME HERE
LOOK AT THESE TROUSERS

140
00:10:56.850 --> 00:10:58.720
GET DOWN AND YOU
TELL ME IF THERE'S
A CREASE ON 'EM?

141
00:10:58.720 --> 00:11:01.460
ALRIGHT LET'S GO
ON THE ROAD IN
"PT" FORMATION.

142
00:11:01.460 --> 00:11:03.760
LET'S MOVE
MOVE MOVE!

143
00:11:03.760 --> 00:11:06.450
PERCONTE LET'S GO
PERCONTE.

144
00:11:09.600 --> 00:11:13.760
PRIVATE WHITE
WHY ARE YOU NOT
IN YOUR PT GEAR?

145
00:11:16.940 --> 00:11:19.870
I ASKED YOU
A QUESTION PRIVATE.

146
00:11:36.890 --> 00:11:38.590
OH "EASY COMPANY".

147
00:11:38.590 --> 00:11:39.860
AND WHILE YOU'RE RUNNING
DON'T WORRY

148
00:11:39.860 --> 00:11:41.930
WE'LL TAKE YOUR DAMES
TO THE MOVIES FOR YOU.

149
00:11:41.930 --> 00:11:45.700
YEAH GOOD THEY NEED
SOME FEMALE COMPANY.

150
00:11:50.640 --> 00:11:52.040
( male )
WHERE DO WE RUN?

151
00:11:52.040 --> 00:11:52.740
( together )
CURRAHEE.

152
00:11:52.740 --> 00:11:54.680
AND WHAT DOES
"CURRAHEE" MEAN?

153
00:11:54.680 --> 00:11:55.780
WE STAND ALONE.

154
00:11:55.780 --> 00:11:57.310
HOW FAR UP
HOW FAR DOWN?

155
00:11:57.310 --> 00:11:59.580
THREE MILES UP
THREE MILES DOWN.

156
00:11:59.580 --> 00:12:01.650
AND WHAT COMPANY
IS THIS?

157
00:12:01.650 --> 00:12:02.980
"EASY COMPANY."

158
00:12:02.980 --> 00:12:04.320
AND WHAT DO WE DO?

159
00:12:04.320 --> 00:12:05.150
STAND ALONE.

160
00:12:05.150 --> 00:12:06.890
DO NOT HELP
THAT MAN!

161
00:12:06.890 --> 00:12:08.460
DO NOT HELP
THAT MAN.

162
00:12:08.460 --> 00:12:10.120
WE DO NOT STOP.

163
00:12:11.290 --> 00:12:14.660
YOU'VE GOT 30 MINUTES TO GET
TO THE TOP OF THIS MOUNTAIN

164
00:12:14.660 --> 00:12:17.900
IF YOU WANNA SERVE
IN THE PARATROOPERS.

165
00:12:17.900 --> 00:12:19.560
HI-HO SILVER!

166
00:12:45.830 --> 00:12:48.430
C'MON YOU CAN
MAKE IT UP THERE.

167
00:12:48.430 --> 00:12:48.860
C'MON.

168
00:12:48.860 --> 00:12:50.430
C'MON NOW C'MON
ALLEY LET'S GO.

169
00:12:50.430 --> 00:12:51.170
C'MON GUARNERE.

170
00:12:51.170 --> 00:12:52.230
CHRISTENSON
C'MON.

171
00:12:52.230 --> 00:12:54.870
I NEVER THOUGHT I'D SEE
THE DAY PRIVATE WYNN.

172
00:12:54.870 --> 00:12:57.500
WE ARE COMING ON
23 MINUTES.

173
00:12:57.770 --> 00:13:01.740
THAT MAY BE GOOD ENOUGH
FOR THE REST OF THE 506

174
00:13:01.740 --> 00:13:05.870
BUT THAT IS NOT GOOD ENOUGH
FOR "EASY COMPANY".

175
00:13:15.320 --> 00:13:18.720
WE CAN MAKE IT
WE CAN DO THIS C'MON.

176
00:13:47.120 --> 00:13:48.960
I'M GONNA
SAY SOMETHING.

177
00:13:48.960 --> 00:13:50.050
TO WHO?

178
00:13:53.990 --> 00:13:55.630
LIEUTENANT WINTERS.

179
00:13:55.630 --> 00:13:57.060
WHAT IS IT?

180
00:13:57.160 --> 00:13:59.630
PERMISSION TO
SPEAK SIR?

181
00:13:59.870 --> 00:14:01.040
PERMISSION GRANTED.

182
00:14:01.040 --> 00:14:03.770
SIR WE GOT
NINE COMPANIES SIR.

183
00:14:03.770 --> 00:14:05.100
THAT WE DO.

184
00:14:06.440 --> 00:14:08.140
WELL HOW COME WE'RE
THE ONLY COMPANY

185
00:14:08.140 --> 00:14:10.980
MARCHING EVERY FRIDAY NIGHT
1 2 MILES FULL PACK

186
00:14:10.980 --> 00:14:12.350
IN THE PITCH DARK?

187
00:14:12.350 --> 00:14:14.350
WHY DO YOU THINK
PRIVATE RANDLEMAN?

188
00:14:14.350 --> 00:14:17.220
LIEUTENANT SOBEL
HATES US SIR.

189
00:14:21.390 --> 00:14:24.560
LIEUTENANT SOBEL
DOES NOT HATE
"EASY COMPANY"

190
00:14:24.560 --> 00:14:26.530
PRIVATE RANDLEMAN.

191
00:14:26.530 --> 00:14:28.460
HE JUST HATES YOU.

192
00:14:29.200 --> 00:14:30.860
THANK YOU SIR.

193
00:14:33.400 --> 00:14:34.170
HE HATES HIM BACK.

194
00:14:34.170 --> 00:14:36.470
HE HATES YOU
TOO MUCK.

195
00:14:37.240 --> 00:14:39.210
LIEUTENANT WINTERS I WANT
CANTEENS OUT OF BELTS

196
00:14:39.210 --> 00:14:40.140
WITH THE CAPS
UNSCREWED.

197
00:14:40.140 --> 00:14:42.010
"EASY COMPANY"
CANTEENS OUT AND OPEN.

198
00:14:42.010 --> 00:14:45.450
ON MY COMMAND THEY WILL POUR
THE CONTENTS ONTO THE GROUND.

199
00:14:45.450 --> 00:14:48.720
ON THE CO's ORDER YOU WILL
UPEND YOUR CANTEEN.

200
00:14:48.720 --> 00:14:49.880
NOW LIEUTENANT.

201
00:14:49.880 --> 00:14:51.040
POUR 'EM.

202
00:14:57.290 --> 00:14:58.690
WHO IS THIS?

203
00:14:58.690 --> 00:14:59.630
CHRISTENSON.

204
00:14:59.630 --> 00:15:02.500
WHY IS THERE NO WATER
IN YOUR CANTEEN?

205
00:15:02.500 --> 00:15:05.170
YOU DRANK FROM YOUR
CANTEEN DIDN'T YOU?

206
00:15:05.170 --> 00:15:05.830
SIR I--

207
00:15:05.830 --> 00:15:06.770
LIEUTENANT WINTERS.

208
00:15:06.770 --> 00:15:07.400
YES SIR.

209
00:15:07.400 --> 00:15:09.340
WAS THIS MAN ORDERED
TO NOT DRINK
FROM HIS CANTEEN

210
00:15:09.340 --> 00:15:11.740
DURING THE FRIDAY
NIGHT MARCH?

211
00:15:11.740 --> 00:15:12.470
HE WAS SIR.

212
00:15:12.470 --> 00:15:14.580
PRIVATE CHRISTENSON
YOU HAVE DISOBEYED
A DIRECT ORDER.

213
00:15:14.580 --> 00:15:15.740
YOU WILL FILL
YOUR CANTEEN

214
00:15:15.740 --> 00:15:19.980
AND REPEAT ALL
12 MILES OF THE
MARCH IMMEDIATELY.

215
00:15:20.150 --> 00:15:21.180
YES SIR.

216
00:15:21.180 --> 00:15:22.440
FALL OUT!

217
00:15:30.290 --> 00:15:33.190
WHAT IN THE NAME
OF GOD ARE YOU
DOING WITH MY COMPANY?

218
00:15:33.190 --> 00:15:35.600
YOU'RE LATE AND
YOU ALLOW TROOPERS

219
00:15:35.600 --> 00:15:37.700
TO DISOBEY
DIRECT ORDERS?

220
00:15:37.700 --> 00:15:39.360
NO EXCUSE SIR.

221
00:15:39.470 --> 00:15:42.900
YOU'RE MAKING ME
LOOK BAD LIEUTENANT.

222
00:15:43.200 --> 00:15:45.640
THIS IS NOT
"DOG COMPANY".

223
00:15:45.640 --> 00:15:47.880
THIS IS NOT
"FOX COMPANY".

224
00:15:47.880 --> 00:15:49.710
THIS THIS IS
"EASY COMPANY".

225
00:15:49.710 --> 00:15:52.310
AND UNDER MY COMMAND
THIS WILL BE THE FIRST

226
00:15:52.310 --> 00:15:55.580
AND FINEST COMPANY
IN THIS REGIMENT.

227
00:15:56.020 --> 00:15:58.610
I WANT THE NAMES
OF SIX MEN

228
00:15:58.750 --> 00:16:00.290
THEIR INFRACTIONS

229
00:16:00.290 --> 00:16:02.760
AND YOUR DISCIPLINARY
RECOMMENDATIONS

230
00:16:02.760 --> 00:16:04.660
ON MY DESK
BY 0130.

231
00:16:04.830 --> 00:16:06.430
IS THAT CLEAR?

232
00:16:06.430 --> 00:16:08.660
WHAT INFRACTIONS
SIR?

233
00:16:09.460 --> 00:16:10.730
FIND SOME.

234
00:16:15.500 --> 00:16:16.700
SO WHAT'D YOU DO?

235
00:16:16.700 --> 00:16:19.940
PICKED SIX MEN AND
GAVE 'EM LATRINE DUTY.

236
00:16:19.940 --> 00:16:21.480
THE LUCKY SIX?

237
00:16:21.480 --> 00:16:23.880
MCDONALD TOYE
PERCONTE

238
00:16:23.880 --> 00:16:24.900
LIPTON

239
00:16:25.980 --> 00:16:27.880
MUCK AND GUARNERE.

240
00:16:28.550 --> 00:16:29.650
WHY THEM?

241
00:16:29.650 --> 00:16:30.850
IT WAS THEIR TURN.

242
00:16:30.850 --> 00:16:32.650
SOBEL'S A GENIUS.

243
00:16:33.020 --> 00:16:36.460
I HAD A HEADMASTER JUST
LIKE HIM IN PREP SCHOOL.

244
00:16:36.460 --> 00:16:37.460
I KNOW THE TYPE.

245
00:16:37.460 --> 00:16:38.390
LEWIS

246
00:16:38.390 --> 00:16:41.360
MICHELANGELO'S A GENIUS
BEETHOVEN'S A GENIUS.

247
00:16:41.360 --> 00:16:42.530
YOU KNOW A MAN
IN THIS COMPANY

248
00:16:42.530 --> 00:16:45.230
WHO WOULDN'T
DOUBLE-TIME CURRAHEE
WITH A FULL PACK

249
00:16:45.230 --> 00:16:48.770
JUST TO PISS
IN THAT GUY'S
MORNING COFFEE?

250
00:16:48.770 --> 00:16:51.470
( Sobel )
LET'S GO LET'S GO.

251
00:16:53.110 --> 00:16:54.840
STAND IN THE DOOR.

252
00:16:54.840 --> 00:16:55.410
GO.

253
00:16:55.410 --> 00:16:56.740
ONE THOUSAND
TWO THOUSAND.

254
00:16:56.740 --> 00:16:59.450
YOU JUST BROKE BOTH
YOUR LEGS PRIVATE GORDON.

255
00:16:59.450 --> 00:17:02.050
ARE YOU TRYING TO
GET YOURSELF KILLED?

256
00:17:02.050 --> 00:17:03.140
NO SIR.

257
00:17:03.750 --> 00:17:05.650
STAND IN THE DOOR.

258
00:17:07.050 --> 00:17:09.020
( loud chattering )

259
00:17:20.070 --> 00:17:20.930
SHIT.

260
00:17:26.340 --> 00:17:28.610
TO THE WALL
TO THE WALL.

261
00:17:28.610 --> 00:17:29.210
OVER AS A TEAM.

262
00:17:29.210 --> 00:17:31.350
GO ON
AGAINST THE WALL.

263
00:17:31.350 --> 00:17:33.910
JESUS WHAT
THE HELL IS THIS?

264
00:17:33.910 --> 00:17:36.040
THAT'S PIG GUTS BOY.

265
00:17:40.690 --> 00:17:42.020
GODDAMMIT!

266
00:17:43.020 --> 00:17:45.330
WHY ARE YOU HERE
PRIVATE GORDON?

267
00:17:45.330 --> 00:17:46.960
I WANNA BE IN
THE AIRBORNE SIR.

268
00:17:46.960 --> 00:17:47.560
I DON'T BELIEVE YOU.

269
00:17:47.560 --> 00:17:49.100
WHY ARE YOU HERE
PRIVATE GORDON?

270
00:17:49.100 --> 00:17:50.460
I WANNA BE IN
THE AIRBORNE SIR.

271
00:17:50.460 --> 00:17:52.330
YOU HAVE 50 MINUTES
TO THE TOP AND BACK

272
00:17:52.330 --> 00:17:54.800
AND I WILL BE
WATCHING YOU.

273
00:17:54.800 --> 00:17:57.270
WHAT ARE YOU
WAITING FOR?

274
00:18:37.310 --> 00:18:41.050
"EASY COMPANY" HAS
THE FINEST PERFORMANCE RECORD

275
00:18:41.050 --> 00:18:43.320
IN THE ENTIRE
2nd BATTALION.

276
00:18:43.320 --> 00:18:46.790
I BELIEVE EVERY
BIT OF THAT IS
THANKS TO YOU.

277
00:18:46.790 --> 00:18:49.590
CONGRATULATIONS
CAPTAIN SOBEL.

278
00:18:49.590 --> 00:18:50.190
THANK YOU SIR.

279
00:18:50.190 --> 00:18:55.420
ISN'T THAT
LIEUTENANT WINTERS LEADING
"EASY COMPANY" IN "PT"?

280
00:18:55.930 --> 00:18:57.120
YES SIR.

281
00:18:57.300 --> 00:18:58.370
HE'S A DAMNED
GOOD MAN.

282
00:18:58.370 --> 00:19:01.700
I WAS PLANNING ON
GIVING HIM A SET
OF THESE TODAY.

283
00:19:01.700 --> 00:19:02.940
WHY DON'T
YOU DO IT?

284
00:19:02.940 --> 00:19:06.030
HE'D BE PROUD
TO GET 'EM FROM YOU.

285
00:19:10.780 --> 00:19:13.080
PORNOGRAPHY
CONTRABAND.

286
00:19:16.620 --> 00:19:19.880
NON-REGULATION CLOTHING
CONTRABAND.

287
00:19:20.120 --> 00:19:24.320
THIS MAN HAD
200 PROPHYLACTIC KITS
IN HIS FOOTLOCKER.

288
00:19:24.320 --> 00:19:27.630
HOW IN THE NAME OF GOD WAS
HE GONNA HAVE THE STRENGTH

289
00:19:27.630 --> 00:19:29.560
TO FIGHT THE WAR?

290
00:19:30.300 --> 00:19:32.230
HOW IS IT PRIVATE
PRIVATE TIPPER

291
00:19:32.230 --> 00:19:36.000
HAS SPARE TIME
FOR SO MUCH
CORRESPONDENCE?

292
00:19:36.900 --> 00:19:41.980
CAPTAIN ARE
PERSONAL LETTERS TO BE
CONSIDERED CONTRABAND?

293
00:19:41.980 --> 00:19:45.310
THESE MEN AREN'T
PARATROOPERS YET
LIEUTENANT.

294
00:19:45.310 --> 00:19:48.180
THEY HAVE NO
PERSONAL PROPERTY.

295
00:19:51.890 --> 00:19:53.490
WHAT IS THIS?

296
00:19:53.490 --> 00:19:54.650
ANYBODY?

297
00:19:55.190 --> 00:19:57.560
ER IT'S A CAN
OF PEACHES SIR.

298
00:19:57.560 --> 00:20:01.760
LIEUTENANT NIXON
THINKS THIS IS A
CAN OF PEACHES.

299
00:20:02.230 --> 00:20:04.030
THAT IS INCORRECT
LIEUTENANT.

300
00:20:04.030 --> 00:20:05.600
YOUR WEEKEND PASS
IS CANCELLED.

301
00:20:05.600 --> 00:20:08.800
THIS IS UNITED STATES
ARMY PROPERTY

302
00:20:09.940 --> 00:20:13.270
WHICH WAS TAKEN
WITHOUT AUTHORIZATION

303
00:20:13.270 --> 00:20:14.680
FROM MY MESS FACILITY

304
00:20:14.680 --> 00:20:18.550
AND I WILL NOT TOLERATE
THIEVERY IN MY UNIT.

305
00:20:18.550 --> 00:20:20.350
WHOSE FOOTLOCKER
IS THIS?

306
00:20:20.350 --> 00:20:22.410
PRIVATE PARKES SIR.

307
00:20:23.250 --> 00:20:24.910
GET RID OF HIM.

308
00:20:26.220 --> 00:20:28.260
ALL WEEKEND PASSES
ARE CANCELLED.

309
00:20:28.260 --> 00:20:30.160
OFFICERS INCLUDED.

310
00:20:32.330 --> 00:20:33.520
CARRY ON.

311
00:20:37.930 --> 00:20:39.920
LIEUTENANT WINTERS.

312
00:20:46.710 --> 00:20:49.640
COLONEL SINK HAS SEEN
FIT TO PROMOTE YOU.

313
00:20:49.640 --> 00:20:54.380
AS 1st LIEUTENANT
YOU'LL SERVE AS MY
EXECUTIVE OFFICER.

314
00:20:54.380 --> 00:20:56.110
CONGRATULATIONS.

315
00:20:56.750 --> 00:20:58.390
THANK YOU SIR.

316
00:20:58.390 --> 00:21:02.290
AND AS A TEST OF YOUR
ORGANIZATIONAL SKILLS

317
00:21:02.420 --> 00:21:04.620
AND COMMAND POTENTIAL

318
00:21:04.960 --> 00:21:07.290
I AM DESIGNATING YOU...

319
00:21:07.490 --> 00:21:09.560
MESS OFFICER
FOR 14 DAYS.

320
00:21:09.560 --> 00:21:13.170
REPORT TO THE MESS
KITCHEN AT 0515 HOURS.

321
00:21:13.170 --> 00:21:16.660
COMPANY BREAKFAST
TO BE SERVED AT 0600.

322
00:21:17.700 --> 00:21:18.900
YES SIR.

323
00:21:20.570 --> 00:21:21.610
OH AND DICK...

324
00:21:21.610 --> 00:21:23.580
THERE'S RAIN
FORECAST TOMORROW

325
00:21:23.580 --> 00:21:27.180
SO THE COMPANY WILL
HAVE A LIGHT AFTERNOON

326
00:21:27.180 --> 00:21:30.510
OF LECTURE AND
CLASSROOM INSTRUCTION.

327
00:21:30.750 --> 00:21:34.620
I THINK A SPECIAL MEAL
BEFORE THEIR AFTERNOON OFF

328
00:21:34.620 --> 00:21:37.360
WOULD BE A WELCOME
CHANGE OF PACE.

329
00:21:37.360 --> 00:21:38.790
WOULD YOU AGREE?

330
00:21:38.790 --> 00:21:39.760
YES SIR.

331
00:21:39.760 --> 00:21:41.590
I LIKE SPAGHETTI.

332
00:21:52.540 --> 00:21:53.410
HOLD ON MORE COMING.

333
00:21:53.410 --> 00:21:56.270
THESE GUYS ARE
PACKING IT AWAY.

334
00:22:07.190 --> 00:22:08.120
THIS STUFF
IS ORANGE.

335
00:22:08.120 --> 00:22:10.820
SPAGHETTI AIN'T
SUPPOSED TO
BE ORANGE.

336
00:22:10.820 --> 00:22:11.660
THIS AIN'T SPAGHETTI.

337
00:22:11.660 --> 00:22:14.230
THIS IS ARMY NOODLES
WITH KETCHUP.

338
00:22:14.230 --> 00:22:16.060
YOU AIN'T
GOTTA EAT IT.

339
00:22:16.060 --> 00:22:18.900
OH C'MON GONORRHEA
AS A FELLOW ITALIAN

340
00:22:18.900 --> 00:22:21.100
YOU SHOULD KNOW
THAT CALLING THIS
CRAP SPAGHETTI

341
00:22:21.100 --> 00:22:21.840
IS A MORTAL SIN.

342
00:22:21.840 --> 00:22:23.340
YOU DON'T WANT IT
I'LL HAVE IT.

343
00:22:23.340 --> 00:22:24.710
NO NO NO
I'M EATING HERE.

344
00:22:24.710 --> 00:22:26.770
HEY GET OUTTA HERE.

345
00:22:26.770 --> 00:22:29.040
ORDERS CHANGED
GET UP!

346
00:22:29.040 --> 00:22:31.280
LECTURES
ARE CANCELLED.

347
00:22:31.280 --> 00:22:33.680
"EASY COMPANY"
IS RUNNING UP CURRAHEE.

348
00:22:33.680 --> 00:22:35.110
MOVE MOVE!

349
00:22:37.180 --> 00:22:40.180
THREE MILES UP
THREE MILES DOWN.

350
00:22:40.990 --> 00:22:42.650
HI-HO SILVER!

351
00:22:44.520 --> 00:22:46.490
LET'S GO LET'S GO.

352
00:22:49.300 --> 00:22:52.130
YOU'RE A WASHOUT
PRIVATE HOOBLER!

353
00:22:52.130 --> 00:22:55.370
YOU SHOULD PACK
UP BOTH YOUR EARS
AND GO HOME.

354
00:22:55.370 --> 00:22:56.900
LOOKS LIKE
GORDON'S DONE.

355
00:22:56.900 --> 00:22:58.610
AREN'T YOU GORDON
YOU FINISHED?

356
00:22:58.610 --> 00:23:01.040
YOU DO NOT DESERVE
TO GET YOUR WINGS.

357
00:23:01.040 --> 00:23:02.210
PRIVATE RANDLEMAN
YOU LOOK TIRED.

358
00:23:02.210 --> 00:23:06.750
THERE'S AN AMBULANCE
WAITING FOR YOU AT
THE BOTTOM OF THE HILL.

359
00:23:06.750 --> 00:23:08.980
IT CAN ALL BE
OVER RIGHT NOW.

360
00:23:08.980 --> 00:23:11.850
NO MORE PAIN
NO MORE CURRAHEE.

361
00:23:12.420 --> 00:23:13.520
NO MORE
CAPTAIN SOBEL.

362
00:23:13.520 --> 00:23:17.620
( chanting )
WE PULL UPON THE RISERS
WE FALL UPON THE GRASS

363
00:23:17.620 --> 00:23:20.290
WE NEVER LAND UPON OUR FEET
WE ALWAYS HIT OUR ASS.

364
00:23:20.290 --> 00:23:24.060
AYE AYE CHRIST ALMIGHTY
WHO THE HELL ARE WE

365
00:23:24.060 --> 00:23:27.300
ZIM-ZAM GODDAMN
WE'RE AIRBORNE INFANTRY

366
00:23:27.300 --> 00:23:31.240
WE PULL UPON THE RISERS
WE FALL UPON THE GRASS

367
00:23:31.240 --> 00:23:34.370
WE NEVER LAND UPON OUR FEET
WE ALWAYS HIT OUR ASS

368
00:23:34.370 --> 00:23:37.910
HIDE TIDEE CHRIST ALMIGHTY
WHO THE HELL ARE WE

369
00:23:37.910 --> 00:23:41.640
ZIM-ZAM GODDAMN
WE'RE AIRBORNE INFANTRY.

370
00:23:53.890 --> 00:23:58.000
SO DO WE FEEL LIKE
WE'RE READY TO BE
ARMY PARATROOPERS?

371
00:23:58.000 --> 00:23:59.600
( together )
YES SERGEANT.

372
00:23:59.600 --> 00:24:00.170
I HOPE SO.

373
00:24:00.170 --> 00:24:04.700
THIS'LL BE THE
FIRST OF FIVE EXITS
FROM A C47 AIRCRAFT

374
00:24:04.700 --> 00:24:06.210
SCHEDULED FOR TODAY.

375
00:24:06.210 --> 00:24:07.510
GET READY.

376
00:24:07.510 --> 00:24:08.700
STAND UP.

377
00:24:10.740 --> 00:24:11.340
HOOK UP.

378
00:24:11.340 --> 00:24:14.680
( Sargeant )
UPON SUCCESSFUL COMPLETION
OF YOUR FIFTH AND FINAL JUMP

379
00:24:14.680 --> 00:24:17.250
YOU'LL BE CERTIFIED
ARMY PARATROOPERS.

380
00:24:17.250 --> 00:24:19.050
CHECK EQUIPMENT!

381
00:24:20.920 --> 00:24:23.790
SOUND-OFF FOR
EQUIPMENT CHECK!

382
00:24:23.960 --> 00:24:25.190
NINE OKAY.

383
00:24:25.260 --> 00:24:26.460
EIGHT OKAY.

384
00:24:26.460 --> 00:24:27.760
SEVEN OKAY.

385
00:24:27.760 --> 00:24:28.960
SIX OKAY.

386
00:24:29.460 --> 00:24:30.730
FIVE OKAY.

387
00:24:31.630 --> 00:24:32.890
FOUR OKAY.

388
00:24:33.170 --> 00:24:34.530
THREE OKAY.

389
00:24:34.670 --> 00:24:35.740
TWO OKAY.

390
00:24:35.740 --> 00:24:36.240
ONE OKAY.

391
00:24:36.240 --> 00:24:38.470
THERE'LL BE A LOT OF MEN
DROPPING FROM THE SKY TODAY.

392
00:24:38.470 --> 00:24:41.670
HOPEFULLY UNDER
DEPLOYED CANOPIES.

393
00:24:43.140 --> 00:24:45.110
STAND IN THE DOOR!

394
00:24:46.580 --> 00:24:49.980
I GUARANTEE YOU'RE GONNA
LOVE IT LIEUTENANT.

395
00:24:49.980 --> 00:24:51.080
GO GO!

396
00:24:51.250 --> 00:24:52.650
JUMPING FRO

397
00:24:53.490 --> 00:24:56.260
IN STICKS OF 12 JUMPERS
PER AIRCRAFT.

398
00:24:56.260 --> 00:24:59.560
ALL YOU HAVE TO DO IS
REMEMBER WHAT YOU WERE TAUGHT

399
00:24:59.560 --> 00:25:04.000
AND I GUARANTEE YOU GRAVITY
WILL TAKE CARE OF THE REST.

400
00:25:04.000 --> 00:25:05.730
GO GO GO GO!

401
00:25:11.740 --> 00:25:13.170
GO GO GO!

402
00:25:18.280 --> 00:25:19.680
GO GO GO!

403
00:25:48.740 --> 00:25:49.770
DAMNIT.

404
00:25:50.610 --> 00:25:52.080
AND GENTLEMEN
REST ASSURED

405
00:25:52.080 --> 00:25:56.140
ANY REFUSALS IN THE AIRCRAFT
OR AT THE DOOR...

406
00:25:56.320 --> 00:25:59.250
AND I GUARANTEE YOU
YOU WILL...

407
00:25:59.790 --> 00:26:02.020
BE OUT OF
THE AIRBORNE.

408
00:26:02.460 --> 00:26:03.720
FOUR OKAY.

409
00:26:03.720 --> 00:26:04.890
THREE OKAY.

410
00:26:04.890 --> 00:26:05.760
TWO OKAY.

411
00:26:05.760 --> 00:26:06.490
ONE OKAY.

412
00:26:06.490 --> 00:26:08.390
STAND IN THE DOOR.

413
00:26:10.830 --> 00:26:11.630
GO!

414
00:26:23.640 --> 00:26:27.310
1000 2000 3000
4000 5000 6000

415
00:26:28.920 --> 00:26:31.040
7000 8000 9000!

416
00:26:31.690 --> 00:26:33.080
( cheering )

417
00:26:35.790 --> 00:26:37.380
HI-HO SILVER.

418
00:26:42.100 --> 00:26:45.600
NOW JUST THINK IF YOU HAD
ANY CLASS OR STYLE LIKE ME

419
00:26:45.600 --> 00:26:47.300
SOMEBODY MIGHT
MISTAKE YOU FOR SOMEBODY.

420
00:26:47.300 --> 00:26:50.630
YOU MEAN LIKE YOUR
FUCKING SERGEANT?

421
00:26:52.010 --> 00:26:53.840
I'M JUST KIDDING.

422
00:26:55.510 --> 00:26:56.980
CONGRATULATIONS
MARTIN.

423
00:26:56.980 --> 00:27:01.680
CORPORAL TOYE THERE WILL BE
NO LEANING IN MY COMPANY.

424
00:27:01.680 --> 00:27:04.280
ARE THOSE DUSTY
JUMP WINGS?

425
00:27:04.990 --> 00:27:07.890
HOW DO YOU EXPECT TO
SLAY THE HUNS

426
00:27:07.890 --> 00:27:09.990
WITH DUST ON
YOUR JUMP WINGS?

427
00:27:09.990 --> 00:27:12.430
LUZ JUST GIVE
ME A DRINK.

428
00:27:12.430 --> 00:27:14.590
HELL OF AN IDEA JOE.

429
00:27:16.260 --> 00:27:17.750
THERE YOU GO.

430
00:27:18.100 --> 00:27:21.120
THREE MILES UP
THREE MILES DOWN.

431
00:27:23.440 --> 00:27:24.630
TEN-HUT!

432
00:27:33.850 --> 00:27:36.440
WELL AT EASE
PARATROOPERS.

433
00:27:37.620 --> 00:27:39.720
GOOD EVENING
"EASY COMPANY".

434
00:27:39.720 --> 00:27:40.490
EVENING SIR.

435
00:27:40.490 --> 00:27:42.890
NOW PARACHUTE INFANTRY
IS A BRAND NEW CONCEPT

436
00:27:42.890 --> 00:27:44.820
IN AMERICAN
MILITARY HISTORY.

437
00:27:44.820 --> 00:27:48.330
BUT BY GOD THE 506 IS GONNA
FORGE THAT BRAND NEW CONCEPT

438
00:27:48.330 --> 00:27:49.820
INTO VICTORY.

439
00:27:50.000 --> 00:27:50.430
YES SIR.

440
00:27:50.430 --> 00:27:52.700
I WANT YOU TO KNOW THAT
I'M DAMNED PROUD

441
00:27:52.700 --> 00:27:54.270
OF EACH AND EVERY
ONE OF YOU.

442
00:27:54.270 --> 00:27:56.900
NOW YOU DESERVE
THIS PARTY.

443
00:27:57.300 --> 00:27:58.740
THANK YOU
SERGEANT GRANT.

444
00:27:58.740 --> 00:27:59.270
SIR.

445
00:27:59.270 --> 00:28:01.070
SO I WANT YOU
TO HAVE FUN...

446
00:28:01.070 --> 00:28:03.280
AND REMEMBER
OUR MOTTO...

447
00:28:03.280 --> 00:28:04.540
CURRAHEE!

448
00:28:04.740 --> 00:28:06.010
CURRAHEE!

449
00:28:06.480 --> 00:28:07.880
( cheering )

450
00:28:33.540 --> 00:28:34.470
PETTY.

451
00:28:34.770 --> 00:28:35.540
MAP.

452
00:28:35.910 --> 00:28:36.840
C'MON.

453
00:28:38.010 --> 00:28:39.340
AH CHRIST.

454
00:28:50.760 --> 00:28:53.390
WE'RE IN THE
WRONG POSITION.

455
00:28:56.730 --> 00:28:57.860
WE'RE IN THE
WRONG POSITION.

456
00:28:57.860 --> 00:29:00.370
WE'RE TEXTBOOK POSITION
FOR AMBUSH SIR.

457
00:29:00.370 --> 00:29:01.430
WE SHOULD SIT TIGHT

458
00:29:01.430 --> 00:29:03.540
LET THE ENEMY TEAM COME
INTO OUR KILLING ZONE.

459
00:29:03.540 --> 00:29:05.270
THEY'RE RIGHT OUT
THERE SOMEWHERE.

460
00:29:05.270 --> 00:29:06.610
LET'S JUST
GET 'EM.

461
00:29:06.610 --> 00:29:08.510
SIR WE HAVE
PERFECT COVER HERE.

462
00:29:08.510 --> 00:29:11.380
LIEUTENANT
DEPLOY YOUR TROOPS.

463
00:29:13.880 --> 00:29:15.180
2nd PLATOON

464
00:29:15.180 --> 00:29:16.340
MOVE OUT.

465
00:29:16.850 --> 00:29:17.780
WHAT?

466
00:29:17.950 --> 00:29:19.680
TACTICAL COLUMN.

467
00:29:37.800 --> 00:29:39.040
CAPTAIN YOU'VE
JUST BEEN KILLED

468
00:29:39.040 --> 00:29:42.440
ALONG WITH 95 PERCENT
OF YOUR COMPANY.

469
00:29:42.440 --> 00:29:43.930
YOUR OUTFIT?

470
00:29:44.310 --> 00:29:47.580
"EASY COMPANY"
2nd BATTALION 506th.

471
00:29:50.780 --> 00:29:53.020
LEAVE THREE WOUNDED
MEN ON THE GROUND

472
00:29:53.020 --> 00:29:56.350
AND REPORT BACK TO
THE ASSEMBLY AREA.

473
00:29:56.420 --> 00:29:57.680
GODDAMMIT.

474
00:30:03.100 --> 00:30:04.690
YOU YOU YOU.

475
00:30:08.330 --> 00:30:09.400
WELL WHAT ARE
YOU GONNA DO?

476
00:30:09.400 --> 00:30:12.670
NOTHING JUST KEEP
TRAINING THE MEN.

477
00:30:13.940 --> 00:30:15.910
AM I INTERRUPTING?

478
00:30:17.580 --> 00:30:18.550
NO NO.

479
00:30:18.550 --> 00:30:20.250
LIEUTENANT LEWIS NIXON.

480
00:30:20.250 --> 00:30:23.480
LIEUTENANT HARRY WELSH
JUST IN FROM THE 82nd.

481
00:30:23.480 --> 00:30:25.190
CONGRATULATIONS
ON THE PROMOTION.

482
00:30:25.190 --> 00:30:26.920
AH THANKS IF YOU
WANNA CALL IT THAT.

483
00:30:26.920 --> 00:30:29.320
YOU'LL LEARN HIM
PRETTY QUICKLY

484
00:30:29.320 --> 00:30:31.390
NO FLAWS NO VICES
NO SENSE OF HUMOR.

485
00:30:31.390 --> 00:30:35.230
JUST LIKE YOUR CHUMS
UP AT BATTALION STAFF.

486
00:30:35.300 --> 00:30:36.600
WHAT'S UP?

487
00:30:36.600 --> 00:30:39.460
I'M HEARING A LOT
OF RUMBLINGS.

488
00:30:39.900 --> 00:30:40.730
SOBEL?

489
00:30:40.730 --> 00:30:42.240
JUST TALKING
ABOUT THAT.

490
00:30:42.240 --> 00:30:45.900
SO HE GETS A LITTLE
JUMPY IN THE FIELD?

491
00:30:45.970 --> 00:30:46.440
HMM-MMM.

492
00:30:46.440 --> 00:30:48.240
HE GETS JUMPY AND
THEN YOU GET KILLED.

493
00:30:48.240 --> 00:30:49.280
THAT'S NICE.

494
00:30:49.280 --> 00:30:51.610
YEAH LISTEN
IF WE DISCUSS IT

495
00:30:51.610 --> 00:30:54.380
I THINK IT SHOULD JUST
BE AMONGST OURSELVES.

496
00:30:54.380 --> 00:30:56.040
OH ABSOLUTELY.

497
00:31:02.820 --> 00:31:04.810
2nd PLATOON READY?

498
00:31:05.390 --> 00:31:06.230
READY SIR.

499
00:31:06.230 --> 00:31:08.660
THEN GET THEM
IN FORMATION.

500
00:31:08.660 --> 00:31:10.260
WE'RE MOVING OUT.

501
00:31:10.260 --> 00:31:11.460
YES SIR.

502
00:31:33.890 --> 00:31:35.320
( laughing )

503
00:31:35.990 --> 00:31:37.580
SHUT UP COBB.

504
00:31:38.260 --> 00:31:39.790
EH YOU GOTTA
ADMIT IT.

505
00:31:39.790 --> 00:31:41.030
HE'S GOT
NO CHANCE.

506
00:31:41.030 --> 00:31:43.330
EITHER THE KRAUTS
WILL GET HIM

507
00:31:43.330 --> 00:31:44.820
OR ONE OF US.

508
00:31:45.130 --> 00:31:46.130
WHO SOBEL?

509
00:31:46.130 --> 00:31:48.300
HE SCREWED UP
ONE MANEUVER.

510
00:31:48.300 --> 00:31:50.870
WELL YOU KNOW
I'M ALWAYS FUMBLING
WITH GRENADES.

511
00:31:50.870 --> 00:31:54.310
IT WOULD BE EASY
IF ONE WENT OFF BY
ACCIDENT YOU KNOW?

512
00:31:54.310 --> 00:31:57.380
WELL NOW THEY
MUST HAVE PUT HIM IN
CHARGE FOR A REASON.

513
00:31:57.380 --> 00:32:02.540
YEAH 'CAUSE THE
ARMY WOULDN'T MAKE A
MISTAKE RIGHT SHIFT?

514
00:32:17.200 --> 00:32:18.730
GOING MY WAY?

515
00:32:18.730 --> 00:32:19.930
WHEREVER THE TRAIN
TAKES ME.

516
00:32:19.930 --> 00:32:21.530
WHERE DO YOU SUPPOSE
THAT MIGHT BE?

517
00:32:21.530 --> 00:32:22.340
I HAVEN'T
GOT A CLUE.

518
00:32:22.340 --> 00:32:23.740
YEAH C'MON
TAKE A GUESS.

519
00:32:23.740 --> 00:32:26.370
ATLANTIC PACIFIC
ATLANTIC?

520
00:32:26.370 --> 00:32:28.940
I'M NOT THE
INTELLIGENCE OFFICER.

521
00:32:28.940 --> 00:32:29.410
MMM.

522
00:32:29.410 --> 00:32:33.750
WELL AS SUCH
I OF COURSE KNOW
BUT IF I TOLD YOU

523
00:32:33.750 --> 00:32:35.010
I'D HAVE TO KILL YOU.

524
00:32:35.010 --> 00:32:36.910
SO DON'T TELL ME.

525
00:32:39.390 --> 00:32:40.590
NEW YORK CITY.

526
00:32:40.590 --> 00:32:41.960
TROOP SHIP.

527
00:32:41.960 --> 00:32:43.080
ENGLAND.

528
00:32:45.860 --> 00:32:48.880
WE'RE INVADING EUROPE
MY FRIEND.

529
00:32:49.230 --> 00:32:50.990
FORTRESS EUROPA.

530
00:32:52.570 --> 00:32:54.800
SINCE WHEN
DO I DRINK?

531
00:32:55.870 --> 00:33:00.640
IF I THOUGHT YOU'D
DRINK IT I WOULDN'T
OFFER IT TO YOU.

532
00:33:01.740 --> 00:33:02.440
NIX?

533
00:33:02.440 --> 00:33:06.640
WHAT ARE YOU GONNA DO
WHEN YOU GET INTO COMBAT?

534
00:33:07.310 --> 00:33:11.420
OH I HAVE EVERY CONFIDENCE
IN MY SCROUNGING ABILITIES.

535
00:33:11.420 --> 00:33:16.120
AND I HAVE A CASE OF VAT 69
HIDDEN IN YOUR FOOTLOCKER.

536
00:33:20.330 --> 00:33:21.420
REALLY?

537
00:33:22.060 --> 00:33:23.260
OH YEAH.

538
00:33:24.560 --> 00:33:25.660
MORNING.

539
00:33:27.000 --> 00:33:27.330
MMM.

540
00:33:27.330 --> 00:33:30.670
THIS COULD
TURN INTO A
REAL NICE TRIP.

541
00:33:46.350 --> 00:33:47.790
( Sobel )
"DEAR SIR OR MADAM

542
00:33:47.790 --> 00:33:50.220
"SOON YOUR SON WILL
DROP FROM THE SKY

543
00:33:50.220 --> 00:33:52.890
"TO ENGAGE AND
DEFEAT THE ENEMY.

544
00:33:52.890 --> 00:33:56.300
"YOUR FREQUENT LETTERS OF
LOVE AND ENCOURAGEMENT

545
00:33:56.300 --> 00:33:58.600
"WILL ARM HIM
WITH A FIGHTING HEART.

546
00:33:58.600 --> 00:34:03.140
"WITH THAT HE CANNOT FAIL
BUT WILL WIN GLORY FOR HIMSELF

547
00:34:03.140 --> 00:34:07.210
"MAKE YOU PROUD OF HIM
AND HIS COUNTRY EVER GRATEFUL

548
00:34:07.210 --> 00:34:09.940
"FOR HIS SERVICE
IN ITS HOUR OF NEED.

549
00:34:09.940 --> 00:34:13.900
SIGNED HERBERT M. SOBEL
CAPTAIN COMMANDING."

550
00:34:26.590 --> 00:34:31.230
RIGHT NOW SOME LUCKY BASTARD'S
HEADED FOR THE SOUTH PACIFIC.

551
00:34:31.230 --> 00:34:32.270
OH WHAT I'D GIVE.

552
00:34:32.270 --> 00:34:34.730
HE'S GONNA GET BILLETED
ON SOME TROPICAL ISLAND...

553
00:34:34.730 --> 00:34:35.540
KEEP TALKING.

554
00:34:35.540 --> 00:34:38.400
SITTING UNDER A PALM TREE
WITH SIX NAKED NATIVE GIRLS

555
00:34:38.400 --> 00:34:40.270
HELPING HIM
CUT UP COCONUTS

556
00:34:40.270 --> 00:34:42.840
SO HE CAN HAND-FEED 'EM
TO THE FLAMINGOS.

557
00:34:42.840 --> 00:34:44.810
FLAMINGOS ARE MEAN.

558
00:34:44.810 --> 00:34:46.080
THEY BITE.

559
00:34:46.080 --> 00:34:47.910
SO DO THE NAKED
NATIVE GIRLS.

560
00:34:47.910 --> 00:34:48.780
WITH ANY LUCK.

561
00:34:48.780 --> 00:34:50.750
HEY GUYS I'M GLAD
I'M GOING TO EUROPE.

562
00:34:50.750 --> 00:34:53.820
HITLER GETS ONE OF THESE
RIGHT ACROSS THE WINDPIPE.

563
00:34:53.820 --> 00:34:57.320
ROOSEVELT CHANGES THANKSGIVING
TO JOE TOYE DAY

564
00:34:57.320 --> 00:35:01.330
AND PAYS ME 10 GRAND
A YEAR FOR THE REST
OF MY FUCKING LIFE.

565
00:35:01.330 --> 00:35:03.460
WHAT IF WE DON'T
GET TO EUROPE?

566
00:35:03.460 --> 00:35:05.630
WHAT IF THEY SEND US
TO NORTH AFRICA?

567
00:35:05.630 --> 00:35:07.900
MY BROTHER'S
IN NORTH AFRICA.

568
00:35:07.900 --> 00:35:08.800
HE SAYS IT'S HOT.

569
00:35:08.800 --> 00:35:11.300
REALLY IT'S HOT
IN AFRICA?

570
00:35:11.300 --> 00:35:11.700
SHUT UP.

571
00:35:11.700 --> 00:35:13.210
THE POINT IS IT DON'T
MATTER WHERE WE GO.

572
00:35:13.210 --> 00:35:15.910
ONCE WE GET INTO COMBAT
THE ONLY PERSON YOU CAN TRUST

573
00:35:15.910 --> 00:35:17.980
IS YOURSELF AND THE
FELLA NEXT TO YOU.

574
00:35:17.980 --> 00:35:21.140
HEY AS LONG AS
HE'S A PARATROOPER.

575
00:35:21.850 --> 00:35:22.280
OH YEAH?

576
00:35:22.280 --> 00:35:25.220
AND WHAT IF THAT PARATROOPER
TURNS OUT TO BE SOBEL?

577
00:35:25.220 --> 00:35:28.960
IF I'M NEXT TO SOBEL
IN COMBAT I'M MOVING
ON DOWN THE LINE.

578
00:35:28.960 --> 00:35:31.260
HOOK UP WITH
SOME OTHER OFFICER

579
00:35:31.260 --> 00:35:32.960
LIKE HEYLIGER
OR WINTERS.

580
00:35:32.960 --> 00:35:34.890
I LIKE WINTERS
HE'S A GOOD MAN.

581
00:35:34.890 --> 00:35:35.860
BUT WHEN THE BULLETS
START FLYING

582
00:35:35.860 --> 00:35:39.270
I DON'T KNOW IF I
WANT A QUAKER DOING
MY FIGHTING FOR ME.

583
00:35:39.270 --> 00:35:41.330
HOW DO YOU KNOW
HE'S A QUAKER?

584
00:35:41.330 --> 00:35:43.230
HE AIN'T CATHOLIC.

585
00:35:43.540 --> 00:35:44.070
NEITHER'S SOBEL.

586
00:35:44.070 --> 00:35:46.210
THAT PRICK'S
THE SON OF ABRAHAM.

587
00:35:46.210 --> 00:35:47.540
HE'S WHAT?

588
00:35:48.880 --> 00:35:50.210
HE'S A JEW.

589
00:35:54.480 --> 00:35:55.520
I'M A JEW.

590
00:35:55.520 --> 00:35:56.950
CONGRATULATIONS.

591
00:35:56.950 --> 00:35:59.650
GET YOUR NOSE
OUT OF MY FACE.

592
00:36:06.360 --> 00:36:08.290
WHAT'S ALL
THAT ABOUT?

593
00:36:08.290 --> 00:36:10.060
GONORRHEA CALLED
SOBEL A JEW.

594
00:36:10.060 --> 00:36:13.960
LIEBGOTT TOOK OFFENSE
'CAUSE HE'S A JEW TOO.

595
00:36:15.130 --> 00:36:18.230
FIGHTING OVER SOBEL
THAT'S SMART.

596
00:36:36.820 --> 00:36:37.950
ATTACK!

597
00:36:41.090 --> 00:36:43.390
NO YOU WANNA
KILL HIM!

598
00:36:43.500 --> 00:36:45.790
PARRY RIGHT
PARRY LEFT.

599
00:36:46.100 --> 00:36:46.930
THRUST!

600
00:36:46.930 --> 00:36:48.300
TAKE COVER.

601
00:36:48.300 --> 00:36:48.670
OKAY.

602
00:36:48.670 --> 00:36:52.800
YESTERDAY WE TALKED ABOUT
MAGNETIC DECLINATION

603
00:36:52.940 --> 00:36:56.040
AND THE LEFT ADD
RIGHT SUBTRACT RULE.

604
00:36:56.040 --> 00:36:57.510
TODAY WE'RE GONNA
PUT IT INTO PRACTICE.

605
00:36:57.510 --> 00:37:00.450
THERE ARE TWO BASIC TYPES
OF FIGHTING POSITIONS.

606
00:37:00.450 --> 00:37:03.520
THE FIRST IS
THE PREPARED POSITION.

607
00:37:03.520 --> 00:37:05.890
THE ADVANTAGES
OF A PREPARED POSITION

608
00:37:05.890 --> 00:37:09.820
ARE THAT IT GIVES YOU
COVER AND CONCEALMENT.

609
00:37:09.820 --> 00:37:11.480
COMMENCE FIRE!

610
00:37:14.830 --> 00:37:18.560
WE'LL THEN MANEUVER
RIGHT IN THROUGH
THESE TREES.

611
00:37:18.560 --> 00:37:20.830
AT THE SAME TIME
OUR 2nd PLATOON

612
00:37:20.830 --> 00:37:23.300
IN THIS PARTICULAR CASE
MOVES OVER HERE.

613
00:37:23.300 --> 00:37:28.330
HE'S THEN GONNA CLOSE
WITH AND KILL OR
CAPTURE THAT GERMAN.

614
00:37:44.620 --> 00:37:45.990
( panting )

615
00:37:52.470 --> 00:37:53.960
SOBEL'S LATE.

616
00:38:05.780 --> 00:38:08.300
WHY IS THERE
A FENCE HERE?

617
00:38:09.480 --> 00:38:12.120
THERE SHOULD BE
NO FENCE HERE.

618
00:38:12.120 --> 00:38:13.020
TIPPER!

619
00:38:13.020 --> 00:38:13.890
YES SIR.

620
00:38:13.890 --> 00:38:15.650
GIVE ME THE MAP.

621
00:38:17.160 --> 00:38:18.560
PERCONTE LUZ.

622
00:38:18.560 --> 00:38:20.860
GET THE MEN
GET 'EM B--

623
00:38:21.130 --> 00:38:22.930
TAKE COVER BEHIND
THOSE TREES.

624
00:38:22.930 --> 00:38:25.560
ALRIGHT YOU
HEARD THE WORD.

625
00:38:29.040 --> 00:38:32.040
THERE SHOULD BE
NO THERE SHOULD
BE NO FENCE HERE.

626
00:38:32.040 --> 00:38:32.470
UM...

627
00:38:32.470 --> 00:38:35.270
( clearing throat )
WE COULD GO
OVER IT SIR.

628
00:38:35.270 --> 00:38:35.680
REALLY?

629
00:38:35.680 --> 00:38:37.940
THAT'S NOT THE POINT
WHERE ARE THE GODDAMN--

630
00:38:37.940 --> 00:38:40.810
WHERE THE GODDAMN
HELL ARE WE?

631
00:38:42.680 --> 00:38:43.520
PERCONTE?

632
00:38:43.520 --> 00:38:44.080
YEAH.

633
00:38:44.080 --> 00:38:45.520
SOBEL'S LOST AGAIN
RIGHT?

634
00:38:45.520 --> 00:38:46.290
YEAH HE'S LOST.

635
00:38:46.290 --> 00:38:47.910
FUCKING CHRIST.

636
00:38:50.790 --> 00:38:53.190
CAN YOU DO
MAJOR HORTON?

637
00:38:53.490 --> 00:38:57.860
( as John Wayne )
DOES A WILD BEAR CRAP
IN THE WOODS SON?

638
00:38:57.860 --> 00:38:58.360
SHH SHH SHH.

639
00:38:58.360 --> 00:39:00.400
MAYBE THE GOOD
MAJOR CAN GOOSE
THIS SCHMUCK.

640
00:39:00.400 --> 00:39:01.900
GET US MOVING?

641
00:39:01.900 --> 00:39:03.100
NO WAY...

642
00:39:03.170 --> 00:39:04.300
OH YEAH YES.

643
00:39:04.300 --> 00:39:05.740
YOU GOTTA
YOU GOTTA.

644
00:39:05.740 --> 00:39:08.040
ALRIGHT
JUST THIS ONCE.

645
00:39:08.510 --> 00:39:09.670
SHH SHH.

646
00:39:13.680 --> 00:39:16.620
THREE FIVE
SIX EIGHT
THREE THREE.

647
00:39:16.620 --> 00:39:18.720
ISN'T THAT
THE INTERSECTION?

648
00:39:18.720 --> 00:39:19.520
NO SIR IT'S HERE.

649
00:39:19.520 --> 00:39:21.220
YOU'RE A FULL
GRID OFF.

650
00:39:21.220 --> 00:39:22.490
GODDAMMIT.

651
00:39:22.490 --> 00:39:25.690
IS THERE A PROBLEM
CAPTAIN SOBEL?

652
00:39:26.590 --> 00:39:27.460
WHO SAID THAT?

653
00:39:27.460 --> 00:39:28.530
WHO BROKE SILENCE?

654
00:39:28.530 --> 00:39:31.390
I THINK IT'S
MAJOR HORTON SIR.

655
00:39:34.070 --> 00:39:34.970
MAJOR HORTON?

656
00:39:34.970 --> 00:39:35.970
WHAT IS HE
DID HE JOIN US?

657
00:39:35.970 --> 00:39:39.410
I THINK MAYBE HE'S MOVING
BETWEEN THE PLATOONS SIR.

658
00:39:39.410 --> 00:39:42.900
WHAT IS THE GODDAMN
HOLDUP MR. SOBEL?

659
00:39:45.850 --> 00:39:47.340
A FENCE SIR.

660
00:39:47.910 --> 00:39:49.180
UM GOD...

661
00:39:49.680 --> 00:39:51.150
A BARBED WIRE FENCE.

662
00:39:51.150 --> 00:39:54.310
OH THAT DOG
JUST AIN'T GONNA HUNT.

663
00:39:54.490 --> 00:39:59.050
NOW YOU CUT THAT FENCE
AND GET THIS GODDAMN PLATOON

664
00:39:59.530 --> 00:40:01.020
ON THE MOVE!

665
00:40:02.330 --> 00:40:03.590
YES SIR!

666
00:40:06.000 --> 00:40:09.200
WHERE ARE MY GODDAMN
WIRE CUTTERS?

667
00:40:10.200 --> 00:40:11.240
WE HAVE TO MOVE.

668
00:40:11.240 --> 00:40:13.640
SIR WITHOUT CAPTAIN
SOBEL AND 1 st PLATOON?

669
00:40:13.640 --> 00:40:16.010
IT'S A "T" INTERSECTION.

670
00:40:16.140 --> 00:40:16.840
WE IMPROVISE.

671
00:40:16.840 --> 00:40:19.610
DOUBLE ENVELOPMENT
LAID ON A BASE OF FIRE

672
00:40:19.610 --> 00:40:21.510
TO CUT THE ROAD
IN ALL DIRECTIONS.

673
00:40:21.510 --> 00:40:22.750
HOOK RIGHT
WITH 1 st SQUAD.

674
00:40:22.750 --> 00:40:24.880
TELL GUARNERE TO
MOVE LEFT WITH 2nd.

675
00:40:24.880 --> 00:40:27.190
I'LL BE RIGHT UP
THE MIDDLE WITH 3rd GO.

676
00:40:27.190 --> 00:40:28.350
YES SIR.

677
00:40:51.210 --> 00:40:52.370
DEARY ME.

678
00:40:55.410 --> 00:40:57.080
( dog barking )

679
00:41:03.060 --> 00:41:04.490
BLOODY HELL.

680
00:41:23.840 --> 00:41:26.250
YOU'VE DONE
IT NOW YANKS.

681
00:41:26.250 --> 00:41:28.210
YOU'VE CAPTURED ME.

682
00:41:32.820 --> 00:41:34.450
HI-HO SILVER!

683
00:41:38.190 --> 00:41:40.390
WOULD THAT BE
THE ENEMY?

684
00:41:40.390 --> 00:41:42.790
AS A MATTER
OF FACT YES.

685
00:41:51.170 --> 00:41:52.200
GOOD WORK
2nd PLATOON.

686
00:41:52.200 --> 00:41:54.330
WE TOOK
THE OBJECTIVE.

687
00:42:02.450 --> 00:42:06.250
WHO IS THE IDIOT WHO
CUT THAT MAN'S FENCE?

688
00:42:06.390 --> 00:42:07.890
I WAS ORDERED TO SIR.

689
00:42:07.890 --> 00:42:08.920
BY WHOM?

690
00:42:08.920 --> 00:42:09.960
MAJOR HORTON SIR.

691
00:42:09.960 --> 00:42:11.420
MAJOR HORTON?

692
00:42:11.420 --> 00:42:11.920
YES SIR.

693
00:42:11.920 --> 00:42:13.590
MAJOR HORTON
TOLD YOU TO DO THAT?

694
00:42:13.590 --> 00:42:14.190
YES SIR.

695
00:42:14.190 --> 00:42:17.400
MAJOR HORTON ORDERED
YOU TO CUT THE FENCE?

696
00:42:17.400 --> 00:42:18.730
YES HE DID.

697
00:42:18.730 --> 00:42:21.930
MAJOR HORTON IS ON
LEAVE IN LONDON.

698
00:42:25.140 --> 00:42:27.660
GET THOSE COWS
OUT OF HERE.

699
00:42:56.270 --> 00:42:58.260
LIEUTENANT WINTERS.

700
00:43:00.670 --> 00:43:04.110
WITH CAPTAIN SOBEL'S
COMPLIMENTS SIR.

701
00:43:06.650 --> 00:43:07.980
LIEUTENANT.

702
00:43:26.230 --> 00:43:28.030
OH FOR CRYING
OUT LOUD.

703
00:43:28.030 --> 00:43:30.500
THIS SPELLS
COURT-MARTIAL.

704
00:43:36.140 --> 00:43:38.180
NO SIR
I DO NOT UNDERSTAND.

705
00:43:38.180 --> 00:43:41.450
YOUR ORDERS TO
ME WERE TO INSPECT
THE LATRINES

706
00:43:41.450 --> 00:43:42.010
AT 1000 HOURS.

707
00:43:42.010 --> 00:43:46.350
FROM 0930 TO 0955
I WAS CENSORING
THE ENLISTED MEN'S MAIL

708
00:43:46.350 --> 00:43:47.290
BY ORDER OF
COLONEL STRAYER.

709
00:43:47.290 --> 00:43:51.590
AT 1 000 HOURS I FOLLOWED
YOUR ORDERS TO THE MINUTE.

710
00:43:51.590 --> 00:43:54.220
I CHANGED THAT
TIME TO 0945.

711
00:43:54.690 --> 00:43:56.430
NO ONE
TOLD ME SIR.

712
00:43:56.430 --> 00:43:57.000
I TELEPHONED.

713
00:43:57.000 --> 00:43:59.470
I'M QUARTERED WITH A FAMILY
THAT HAS NO TELEPHONE.

714
00:43:59.470 --> 00:44:00.870
AND SENT A RUNNER.

715
00:44:00.870 --> 00:44:02.000
NO RUNNER FOUND
ME CAPTAIN.

716
00:44:02.000 --> 00:44:07.440
IRREGARDLESS WHEN GIVEN
A TASK TO PERFORM
BY A RANKING OFFICER

717
00:44:10.510 --> 00:44:11.810
TO ANOTHER OFFICER.

718
00:44:11.810 --> 00:44:12.480
YOU FAILED TO DO SO.

719
00:44:12.480 --> 00:44:16.720
WERE I TO LET
SUCH A FAILURE OF DUTY
BY MY OWN XO GO UNPUNISHED

720
00:44:16.720 --> 00:44:18.950
WHAT KIND OF MESSAGE
IS THAT TO THE MEN?

721
00:44:18.950 --> 00:44:21.920
I PERFORMED MY DUTY
AS I WAS ORDERED SIR.

722
00:44:21.920 --> 00:44:22.720
AND I DISAGREE.

723
00:44:22.720 --> 00:44:26.360
SO YOUR OPTIONS ARE
QUITE SIMPLE LIEUTENANT.

724
00:44:26.360 --> 00:44:30.400
PUNISHMENT FOR YOUR OFFENSES
WILL BE DENIAL OF

725
00:44:30.400 --> 00:44:32.770
A 48-HOUR PASS
FOR 60 DAYS.

726
00:44:32.770 --> 00:44:35.460
STAND BEFORE ME
AT ATTENTION.

727
00:44:37.340 --> 00:44:39.270
OR YOU MAY INITIATE
A LETTER OF APPEAL

728
00:44:39.270 --> 00:44:42.640
AND REQUEST A TRIAL
BY COURT-MARTIAL.

729
00:44:46.510 --> 00:44:48.750
YOU SPEND YOUR WEEKENDS
ON THE BASE ANYWAY DICK.

730
00:44:48.750 --> 00:44:51.550
BE A MAN
TAKE THE PUNISHMENT.

731
00:44:51.920 --> 00:44:54.550
MAY I BORROW
YOUR PEN SIR?

732
00:45:06.370 --> 00:45:08.420
MY ENDORSEMENT SIR.

733
00:45:09.070 --> 00:45:12.060
I REQUEST TRIAL
BY COURT-MARTIAL.

734
00:45:22.580 --> 00:45:25.120
WE LOST WINTERS
TO BATTALION MESS.

735
00:45:25.120 --> 00:45:26.890
YOU'RE SHITTING ME.

736
00:45:26.890 --> 00:45:27.350
NO.

737
00:45:27.350 --> 00:45:29.720
STRAYER DID IT WHILE THEY TRY
TO FIGURE OUT THE PROCEDURES

738
00:45:29.720 --> 00:45:30.660
FOR HIS COURT-MARTIAL.

739
00:45:30.660 --> 00:45:33.760
WELL NIX BETTER
FIND A LOOPHOLE
AND GET HIM OUT.

740
00:45:33.760 --> 00:45:34.660
AND IF HE DON'T?

741
00:45:34.660 --> 00:45:35.530
WINTERS SCRAMBLES EGGS

742
00:45:35.530 --> 00:45:39.900
WHILE THE REST OF US MAKE
THE BIG JUMP WITH SOBEL.

743
00:45:40.600 --> 00:45:41.590
NOT ME.

744
00:45:42.300 --> 00:45:44.270
SO WE'RE GOING THROUGH
WITH THIS RIGHT?

745
00:45:44.270 --> 00:45:46.640
WE'VE GOTTA
DO SOMETHING.

746
00:45:48.540 --> 00:45:49.400
YEAH.

747
00:45:49.610 --> 00:45:50.730
ALRIGHT.

748
00:45:51.810 --> 00:45:52.670
GOOD.

749
00:45:53.910 --> 00:45:56.620
BUT WE'D ALL BETTER
BE CLEAR OF THE
CONSEQUENCES.

750
00:45:56.620 --> 00:45:59.520
I DON'T CARE ABOUT
THE CONSEQUENCES.

751
00:45:59.520 --> 00:46:03.510
WE COULD BE LINED UP
AGAINST A WALL AND SHOT.

752
00:46:03.890 --> 00:46:06.520
NOW I'M READY
TO FACE THAT.

753
00:46:08.130 --> 00:46:11.620
AND EVERY ONE OF US
HAD BETTER BE TOO.

754
00:46:15.900 --> 00:46:19.390
I WILL NOT FOLLOW
THAT MAN INTO COMBAT.

755
00:46:23.210 --> 00:46:24.570
ME NEITHER.

756
00:46:27.550 --> 00:46:28.640
ALRIGHT.

757
00:46:29.850 --> 00:46:31.680
THEN LET'S DO IT.

758
00:46:45.500 --> 00:46:46.830
I HEREBY...

759
00:46:47.600 --> 00:46:49.000
NO LONGER...

760
00:46:51.640 --> 00:46:53.370
WISH TO SERVE...

761
00:46:56.010 --> 00:46:58.980
AS A NON-COMMISSIONED
OFFICER...

762
00:47:04.920 --> 00:47:06.820
IN "EASY COMPANY".

763
00:47:20.930 --> 00:47:22.500
ALRIGHT BOYS.

764
00:47:22.500 --> 00:47:23.760
GOOD LUCK.

765
00:47:28.370 --> 00:47:30.710
I OUGHT TO HAVE
YOU ALL SHOT!

766
00:47:30.710 --> 00:47:33.110
THIS IS NOTHING LESS
THAN AN ACT OF MUTINY

767
00:47:33.110 --> 00:47:36.420
WHILE WE PREPARE FOR THE
GODDAMN INVASION OF EUROPE.

768
00:47:36.420 --> 00:47:38.180
SERGEANT HARRIS.

769
00:47:38.380 --> 00:47:39.220
YES SIR.

770
00:47:39.220 --> 00:47:40.750
TURN IN YOUR STRIPES
COLLECT YOUR GEAR.

771
00:47:40.750 --> 00:47:44.320
YOU ARE HEREBY TRANSFERRED
OUT OF MY REGIMENT.

772
00:47:44.320 --> 00:47:45.520
YES SIR.

773
00:47:45.790 --> 00:47:46.880
GET OUT.

774
00:47:47.790 --> 00:47:49.390
SERGEANT RANNEY.

775
00:47:49.390 --> 00:47:49.900
SIR.

776
00:47:49.900 --> 00:47:52.630
YOU CONSIDER YOURSELF
LUCKY I'M ONLY
BUSTING YOU TO PRIVATE.

777
00:47:52.630 --> 00:47:56.770
ALL OF YOU NCOs
HAVE DISGRACED
THE 101st AIRBORNE.

778
00:47:56.770 --> 00:47:59.910
YOU CAN CONSIDER
YOURSELF LUCKY THAT
WE ARE ON THE EVE

779
00:47:59.910 --> 00:48:02.270
OF THE LARGEST
ACTION IN THE
HISTORY OF WARFARE

780
00:48:02.270 --> 00:48:06.680
WHICH LEAVES ME
NO CHOICE BUT TO
SPARE YOUR LIVES.

781
00:48:08.650 --> 00:48:13.050
NOW GET OUT OF MY OFFICE
AND GET OUT OF MY SIGHT.

782
00:48:13.390 --> 00:48:14.180
GET.

783
00:48:30.240 --> 00:48:32.340
KEEP 'EM COMING
THAT-A-BOY.

784
00:48:32.340 --> 00:48:33.600
THAT'S IT.

785
00:49:05.940 --> 00:49:07.440
I CAN ONLY
SPECULATE SIR.

786
00:49:07.440 --> 00:49:09.110
MOST OF THE MEN WOULD
WOULD NEVER DO THIS

787
00:49:09.110 --> 00:49:12.410
BUT I BELIEVE JUST
A FEW OF THE SERGEANTS

788
00:49:12.410 --> 00:49:16.010
MAY HAVE FELT
THEIR LOYALTY LAY
MORE TO THE PLATOON

789
00:49:16.010 --> 00:49:16.750
THAN TO THE COMPANY.

790
00:49:16.750 --> 00:49:21.990
AND THESE FEW SERGEANTS
CONVINCED ALL OF THE OTHER
NCOs IN YOUR COMPANY

791
00:49:21.990 --> 00:49:24.090
TO TURN IN
THEIR STRIPES?

792
00:49:24.090 --> 00:49:24.790
AS STAFF SERGEANTS

793
00:49:24.790 --> 00:49:25.820
THEY HAVE A GREAT AMOUNT
OF INFLUENCE SIR.

794
00:49:25.820 --> 00:49:27.760
BUT AS I SAY
THE REST ARE GOOD MEN.

795
00:49:27.760 --> 00:49:30.850
I KNOW THEM
I CAN WORK WITH THEM.

796
00:49:36.670 --> 00:49:39.140
THIS BUSINESS WITH
THE WINTERS' COURT-MARTIAL

797
00:49:39.140 --> 00:49:41.740
HAS BEEN AN
UNPLEASANT DISTRACTION.

798
00:49:41.740 --> 00:49:44.300
INDEED INDEED
IT HAS SIR.

799
00:49:44.940 --> 00:49:45.740
HOWEVER...

800
00:49:45.740 --> 00:49:49.150
YOUR COMMAND
OF "EASY COMPANY"
HAS BEEN EXEMPLARY.

801
00:49:49.150 --> 00:49:50.180
THANK THANK
YOU SIR.

802
00:49:50.180 --> 00:49:55.020
IN FACT EXCEPT FOR
THE ACTIONS OF A
FEW OF YOUR NONCOMS

803
00:49:55.020 --> 00:49:59.320
I BELIEVE YOU'VE FIELDED
ONE OF THE FINEST
COMPANIES OF SOLDIERS

804
00:49:59.320 --> 00:50:00.990
I'VE EVER SEEN.

805
00:50:02.030 --> 00:50:02.660
YES SIR.

806
00:50:02.660 --> 00:50:05.650
HERBERT DIVISION
HAS ESTABLISHED

807
00:50:05.860 --> 00:50:08.900
A PARACHUTE TRAINING
SCHOOL AT CHILTON FOLIAT.

808
00:50:08.900 --> 00:50:12.340
THE IDEA IS FOR
NON-INFANTRY TYPES WHO...

809
00:50:12.340 --> 00:50:14.510
WERE VITAL TO
THE COMING INVASION

810
00:50:14.510 --> 00:50:19.600
SUCH AS DOCTORS AND CHAPLAINS
TO TAKE JUMP TRAINING THERE.

811
00:50:19.880 --> 00:50:22.780
FRANKLY I CAN'T THINK
OF ANYONE MORE
QUALIFIED TO COMMAND

812
00:50:22.780 --> 00:50:25.310
SUCH A SCHOOL
THAN YOU ARE.

813
00:50:28.850 --> 00:50:29.720
SIR?

814
00:50:32.820 --> 00:50:36.260
I'M REASSIGNING YOU
TO CHILTON FOLIAT.

815
00:50:44.270 --> 00:50:46.790
I'M LOSING
"EASY COMPANY"?

816
00:50:47.040 --> 00:50:50.240
THE WAR EFFORT
NEEDS YOU ELSEWHERE.

817
00:50:55.850 --> 00:50:58.320
PERMISSION TO
SPEAK SIR?

818
00:50:58.620 --> 00:50:59.710
GRANTED.

819
00:51:02.990 --> 00:51:05.720
IS WHO WHO WILL
BE REPLACING ME?

820
00:51:05.720 --> 00:51:09.850
LIEUTENANT MEEHAN FROM
