821
00:51:11.530 --> 00:51:13.900
GOOD LUCK AT
CHILTON FOLIAT HERBERT.

822
00:51:13.900 --> 00:51:16.030
DON'T LET US
DOWN NOW.

823
00:51:22.770 --> 00:51:23.900
NO SIR.

824
00:51:30.520 --> 00:51:31.710
CARRY ON.

