890
00:55:06.200 --> 00:55:09.190
GREEN LIGHT
RIGHT OVER RAMSBURY.

891
00:55:09.970 --> 00:55:10.970
RAMSBURY.

892
00:55:10.970 --> 00:55:12.440
EVERY SINGLE TIME.

893
00:55:12.440 --> 00:55:15.930
LINEAR DISTANCE ON
THE GRID OF ABOUT...

894
00:55:19.380 --> 00:55:20.240
OKAY.

895
00:55:21.010 --> 00:55:21.850
RAMSBURY

896
00:55:21.850 --> 00:55:23.040
UPOTTERY.

897
00:55:32.520 --> 00:55:33.390
SO...

898
00:55:33.630 --> 00:55:35.180
IT'S NORMANDY.

899
00:55:37.260 --> 00:55:38.860
( Nixon )
ST. MARIE DU MONT.

900
00:55:38.860 --> 00:55:40.300
CAUSEWAY NUMBER ONE.

901
00:55:40.300 --> 00:55:41.730
CAUSEWAY NUMBER TWO.

902
00:55:41.730 --> 00:55:43.540
THE ULTIMATE
FIELD PROBLEM.

