00:56:08.660 --> 00:56:11.660
... LINKING OMAH AND UTAH
INTO ONE CONTINUOUS BEACHHEAD.

913
00:56:11.660 --> 00:56:14.730
EACH TROOPER WILL
LEARN THIS OPERATION BY HEART

914
00:56:14.730 --> 00:56:18.200
AND KNOW HIS AND EVERY
OTHER OUTFITS' MISSION

915
00:56:18.200 --> 00:56:19.770
TO THE DETAIL.

916
00:56:19.770 --> 00:56:20.970
LIEUTENANT MEEHAN?

917
00:56:20.970 --> 00:56:21.540
YES DUKEMAN.

918
00:56:21.540 --> 00:56:22.710
SIR ARE WE
DROPPING TONIGHT?

919
00:56:22.710 --> 00:56:24.580
WHEN IT'S TIME FOR YOU TO
KNOW WE'LL LET YOU KNOW.

920
00:56:24.580 --> 00:56:28.180
IN THE MEANTIME
STUDY THESE SAND
TABLES MAPS

921
00:56:28.180 --> 00:56:28.880
AND RECONNAISSANCE PHOTOS

922
00:56:28.880 --> 00:56:31.580
UNTIL YOU CAN DRAW A MAP
