923
00:56:31.580 --> 00:56:34.090
NOW WE WILL DROP
BEHIND THIS ATLANTIC WALL

924
00:56:34.090 --> 00:56:38.260
FIVE HOURS BEFORE
THE 4th INFANTRY
LANDS AT UTAH.

