927
00:56:43.930 --> 00:56:46.530
RIGHT HERE IN THIS AREA
ST. MARIE DU MONT.

928
00:56:46.530 --> 00:56:50.260
"EASY COMPANY" WILL
DESTROY THAT GARRISON.

