$10000.

963
00:58:14.850 --> 00:58:16.980
YOU HEAR THAT
GERRY?

964
00:58:17.960 --> 00:58:18.960
HEY LIP?

965
00:58:18.960 --> 00:58:20.220
YEAH BOY.

966
00:58:21.230 --> 00:58:24.600
HAS GUARNERE SAID
ANYTHING TO YOU
ABOUT HIS BROTHER?

967
00:58:24.600 --> 00:58:25.290
NO.

968
00:58:25.630 --> 00:58:26.300
I GOT A PROBLEM.

969
00:58:26.300 --> 00:58:28.770
MY WIFE KEEPS UP
WITH THINGS BACK HOME

970
00:58:28.770 --> 00:58:30.740
CASUALTY LISTS
AND LIKE THAT.

971
00:58:30.740 --> 00:58:31.270
YEAH?

972
00:58:31.270 --> 00:58:33.640
GUARNERE'S BROTHER
IN ITALY?

973
00:58:33.640 --> 00:58:34.510
HENRY?

974
00:58:34.510 --> 00:58:36.670
KILLED IN
MONTE CASSINO.

975
00:58:36.670 --> 00:58:39.540
WELL I'M SURE
HE DOESN'T KNOW.

976
00:58:40.180 --> 00:58:40.980
DAMN.

977
00:58:40.980 --> 00:58:42.510
WHAT'D YOU THINK
I SHOULD DO?

978
00:58:42.510 --> 00:58:45.140
IF IT WERE ME
I'D TELL HIM.

979
00:58:46.080 --> 00:58:48.950
COUPLE OF HOURS
BEFORE WE JUMP?

980
00:58:48.950 --> 00:58:50.440
I DON'T KNOW.

981
00:59:00.900 --> 00:59:03.070
WHY THEY SPRINGING
THESE THINGS ON US NOW?

982
00:59:03.070 --> 00:59:06.340
IT'S JUST AN EXTRA 80 POUNDS
STRAPPED TO YOUR LEG.

983
00:59:06.340 --> 00:59:11.370
DOES ANYBODY HAVE ANY IDEA HOW
THE HELL THIS THING WORKS?

984
00:59:12.010 --> 00:59:13.500
COLONEL SINK.

985
00:59:15.950 --> 00:59:17.440
COLONEL SINK.

986
00:59:19.050 --> 00:59:21.290
"SOLDIERS OF
THE REGIMENT:

987
00:59:21.290 --> 00:59:23.410
"TONIGHT IS THE NIGHT

988
00:59:25.390 --> 00:59:26.560
"OF NIGHTS.

989
00:59:26.560 --> 00:59:30.260
"TODAY AS YOU READ THIS
YOU ARE EN ROUTE

990
00:59:30.260 --> 00:59:33.200
"TO THE GREAT
ADVENTURE FOR WHICH
YOU HAVE TRAINED FOR

991
00:59:33.200 --> 00:59:34.930
OVER TWO YEARS."

992
00:59:35.770 --> 00:59:39.170
SO THAT'S WHY THEY
GAVE US ICE CREAM.

993
00:59:41.040 --> 00:59:43.600
"EASY COMPANY"
LISTEN UP!

994
00:59:45.410 --> 00:59:48.880
CHANNEL COAST IS SOCKED
IN WITH RAIN AND FOG.

995
00:59:48.880 --> 00:59:50.640
NO JUMP TONIGHT.

996
00:59:50.950 --> 00:59:53.550
THE INVASION
HAS BEEN POSTPONED.

997
00:59:53.550 --> 00:59:56.350
WE'RE ON A 24-HOUR
STAND-DOWN.

998
00:59:59.660 --> 01:00:02.460
Well this is
quite a surprise.

999
01:00:02.460 --> 01:00:03.230
Not particularly.

1000
01:00:03.230 --> 01:00:05.400
It so happens
I rather expected it.

1001
01:00:05.400 --> 01:00:09.860
Well I can't see
how you people can
pass up $80000

1002
01:00:10.370 --> 01:00:11.930
for the cause.

1003
01:00:12.440 --> 01:00:13.170
For whose cause?

1004
01:00:13.170 --> 01:00:16.010
If you're so interested
in serving a cause

1005
01:00:16.010 --> 01:00:17.810
why don't you
join the army?

1006
01:00:17.810 --> 01:00:19.300
Next please.

1007
01:00:23.580 --> 01:00:24.220
Oh 4-M.

1008
01:00:24.220 --> 01:00:25.620
You look
1 -A to me.

1009
01:00:25.620 --> 01:00:28.880
Hey you don't
look so bad yourself.

1010
01:00:30.190 --> 01:00:31.090
"DEAREST JOHNNY."

1011
01:00:31.090 --> 01:00:33.990
Well should you
be giving blood?

1012
01:00:33.990 --> 01:00:35.250
I woke up.

1013
01:00:37.160 --> 01:00:39.300
I GOT THE WRONG
GODDAMN JACKET.

1014
01:00:39.300 --> 01:00:39.960
SHH.

1015
01:00:39.960 --> 01:00:42.430
I was struck
by lightning.

1016
01:00:49.970 --> 01:00:51.040
Nobody dancing.

1017
01:00:51.040 --> 01:00:52.870
It doesn't
matter.

1018
01:00:53.140 --> 01:00:56.580
"YOUR PAL BILL
GUARNERE'S BROTHER..."

1019
01:01:04.260 --> 01:01:05.590
( panting )

1020
01:02:29.270 --> 01:02:30.610
GOOD LUCK LADS.

1021
01:02:30.610 --> 01:02:31.980
SEE YOU TOMMY.

1022
01:02:31.980 --> 01:02:33.570
SEE YOU MATE.

1023
01:02:46.260 --> 01:02:49.590
TRY AND GET THESE
LEG STRAPS THROUGH.

1024
01:02:54.600 --> 01:02:55.690
JOHNNY?

1025
01:03:01.310 --> 01:03:04.010
GOT SOMETHING
YOU MIGHT BE
LOOKING FOR.

1026
01:03:04.010 --> 01:03:06.640
TOOK YOUR JACKET
BY MISTAKE.

1027
01:03:06.710 --> 01:03:07.780
I'M SORRY.

1028
01:03:07.780 --> 01:03:09.270
YOU READ IT?

1029
01:03:10.720 --> 01:03:12.850
WHERE THE FUCK IS
MONTE CASSINO?

1030
01:03:12.850 --> 01:03:14.150
I DON'T KNOW.

1031
01:03:14.150 --> 01:03:15.880
ITALY SOMEWHERE.

1032
01:03:18.220 --> 01:03:21.090
SORRY ABOUT
YOUR BROTHER BILL

1033
01:03:25.100 --> 01:03:26.620
HE WAS ER...

1034
01:03:31.270 --> 01:03:33.670
LET'S GET
THIS OVER WITH.

1035
01:03:36.970 --> 01:03:37.910
BILL?

1036
01:03:40.780 --> 01:03:43.800
I'LL MEET UP
WITH YOU OVER THERE.

1037
01:03:46.580 --> 01:03:50.320
GENTLEMEN DOC ROE
IS HANDING THESE
OUT FOR AIR SICKNESS.

1038
01:03:50.320 --> 01:03:52.390
ORDERS ARE EVERY MAN
TAKES ONE NOW

1039
01:03:52.390 --> 01:03:55.150
ANOTHER 30 MINUTES
IN THE AIR.

1040
01:03:56.060 --> 01:03:57.430
LIEUTENANT.

1041
01:04:03.230 --> 01:04:05.460
2nd PLATOON
LISTEN UP.

1042
01:04:08.970 --> 01:04:10.240
GOOD LUCK.

1043
01:04:12.040 --> 01:04:13.640
GOD BLESS YOU.

1044
01:04:14.480 --> 01:04:17.570
I'LL SEE YOU IN
THE ASSEMBLY AREA.

1045
01:05:12.170 --> 01:05:13.240
IF THE WIRE CONSTANT
IS SENSITIVE

1046
01:05:13.240 --> 01:05:17.540
THEN I THINK ALL
WE SHOULD HAVE TO
DEAL WITH IS...

1047
01:05:22.010 --> 01:05:22.850
GODDAMN LIEB.

1048
01:05:22.850 --> 01:05:26.180
THAT AIRSICK PILL
IS MAKING ME LOOPY.

